    "detailed_description": "<strong>Let's build the routes that connect the platforms. </strong><br><br>This is a first-person puzzle game where you have to understand the algorithm and select the correct nodes.<br>Think carefully with a drone as a companion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353830/extras/Introduce.GIF?t=1717034857\" /></span><br><br>L-ROOM is a puzzle game where you build a route from a starting platform to a platform with the Teleporter to get to the next room.<br>Build the correct route in the unique hologram displayed by the drone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353830/extras/b252e12f605644f0a0397b733e83dce9.avif?t=1717034857\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Node-based program for building routes</h2>Shown inside the hologram is a node-based program consisting of several pages.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The &quot;Seed&quot; page that sets the initial node list.<br></li><li>The &quot;Branch&quot; page that defines how node will change.<br></li><li>The &quot;Generation&quot; page that determines how many times to grow the node list.<br></li><li>The &quot;Tree&quot; page to browse the built results.</li></ul>Fix empty or incorrect nodes in the node list on the &quot;Seed&quot; and &quot;Branch&quot; pages.<br>You can view the build results on the &quot;Tree&quot; page at always.<br>There is no time limit or number of revisions allowed. You can repeat trial and error as many times as you like until you build the correct route.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353830/extras/82d5734496eafba344912e805921e211.avif?t=1717034857\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Node types</h2>The route is deployed in 3D space.<br>6 types of nodes for going straight:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>X+ and X-<br></li><li>Y+ and Y-<br></li><li>Z+ and Z-</li></ul>in addition, there are 24 types of nodes for turning and 10 types for &quot;Generation&quot; page.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353830/extras/27533eaf990eb94788853161a502e52c.avif?t=1717034857\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you can build the correct route</h2>Once you have built the correct route, use the Floater to move to the platform with the Teleporter.<br>You enter the Teleporter will transition to the next room.<br>Please try to escape from all rooms!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>UI with only symbols and numbers.<br></li><li>Full controller support.<br></li><li>Steam cloud save.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Let's build the routes that connect the platforms. </strong><br><br>This is a first-person puzzle game where you have to understand the algorithm and select the correct nodes.<br>Think carefully with a drone as a companion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353830/extras/Introduce.GIF?t=1717034857\" /></span><br><br>L-ROOM is a puzzle game where you build a route from a starting platform to a platform with the Teleporter to get to the next room.<br>Build the correct route in the unique hologram displayed by the drone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353830/extras/b252e12f605644f0a0397b733e83dce9.avif?t=1717034857\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Node-based program for building routes</h2>Shown inside the hologram is a node-based program consisting of several pages.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The &quot;Seed&quot; page that sets the initial node list.<br></li><li>The &quot;Branch&quot; page that defines how node will change.<br></li><li>The &quot;Generation&quot; page that determines how many times to grow the node list.<br></li><li>The &quot;Tree&quot; page to browse the built results.</li></ul>Fix empty or incorrect nodes in the node list on the &quot;Seed&quot; and &quot;Branch&quot; pages.<br>You can view the build results on the &quot;Tree&quot; page at always.<br>There is no time limit or number of revisions allowed. You can repeat trial and error as many times as you like until you build the correct route.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353830/extras/82d5734496eafba344912e805921e211.avif?t=1717034857\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Node types</h2>The route is deployed in 3D space.<br>6 types of nodes for going straight:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>X+ and X-<br></li><li>Y+ and Y-<br></li><li>Z+ and Z-</li></ul>in addition, there are 24 types of nodes for turning and 10 types for &quot;Generation&quot; page.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353830/extras/27533eaf990eb94788853161a502e52c.avif?t=1717034857\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you can build the correct route</h2>Once you have built the correct route, use the Floater to move to the platform with the Teleporter.<br>You enter the Teleporter will transition to the next room.<br>Please try to escape from all rooms!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>UI with only symbols and numbers.<br></li><li>Full controller support.<br></li><li>Steam cloud save.</li></ul>",
